  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CATE-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And as to you, young Atraydies... did you honestly expect to walk in from the desert and be handed the lordship like some kind of treat?",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/CountTirgisCrowl_MIR_06.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381310,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CATE-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I have the right by blood, Crowl. I passed the Binny Jezzerit's trials, and I finally rid us of the Great Wurm Melanj.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Sorcerer_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PolAtraydies_MIR_24.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381317,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CATE-NPC08_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "He speaks truly. Despite his defiance in attacking Melanj, the Reverend Mother supports Atraydies' claim. It is your duty to step aside, Count.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_SorcererF_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/SisterIroolan_MIR_01.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381326,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CATE-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I will do no such thing. You Sisters can say Atraydies has the better breeding, but Murdak correct me if I'm wrong, mustn't they show proof?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Warrior_H_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/CountTirgisCrowl_MIR_07.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381310,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CATE-NPC04_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Hm... what? Oh, yes... I believe that is true. Yes. To settle such matters, we've always consulted the House Chronoshard...",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Djinn_Wizard_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Murdak_MIR_04.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381311,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CATE-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Which has always been held in good faith by our vassal... and with House Purrzian in open rebellion, I fear we are at an impasse.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Warrior_H_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/CountTirgisCrowl_MIR_08.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381310,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CATE-NPC06_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I think not. The Wizard and I can swiftly remedy the situation. We will go to the Vassal Manse and retrieve the House Chronoshard by force.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Cat_Sorcerer_B_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/PolAtraydies_MIR_25.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381317,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "MR-CATE-NPC03_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So you intend to storm the Vassal Manse and take on House Purrzian by yourselves? Very well, Atraydies' death will settle this matter too.",
            "m_picture": "",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/CountTirgisCrowl_MIR_09.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1381310,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
